Diagnosis
---------
This is a general Docker Desktop visibility boundary for this host's /tmp and
/private/tmp paths, not a missing image and not a function-file defect. The
Supabase CLI's generated bind used the invisible canonical /private/tmp path;
the destination became a directory, so Edge Runtime could not select index.ts.
An owned snapshot under the Docker-shared /Users tree is the confirmed local
prerequisite for rerunning this harness. No whole-suite retry was attempted.
